{"id":"wb-7-1323","name":"潼川古城墙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"潼川古城牆","text":"潼川古城墙，位于四川省三台县潼川镇。现存长度2000余米。是潼川府府城的城墙。1996年9月16日公布为四川省第四批省级文物保护单位；2013年3月5日列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%BD%BC%E5%B7%9D%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E7%89%86","revisionId":76620709,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=76620709","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5445ee1f6ee7dfdd378c00a6.jpg","title":"潼川古城墙照片.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%BD%BC%E5%B7%9D%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E5%A2%99%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/72/%E6%BD%BC%E5%B7%9D%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E5%A2%99%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Tongchuan ancient city wall","width":320,"height":213}}